The TinyTapeout tile under tt/tile is a separate repository, included here as
a submodule, and carries its own copyright and licence.

fpga/boards/*.yaml contain pin assignments derived from board vendors' own
constraint files (Digilent, 1BitSquared/icebreaker-fpga, emard/ulx3s, Sipeed,
Terasic via f32c). Those files are NOT redistributed here: each board file
records the source URL and its SHA-256, and tools/import_boards.py downloads
them on demand.
